        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate casts its dice—and I see. I see that you'll take on the role of a girl. Hair like fire, born in a black hut near the graveyard. It's no easy role, and your choices are many: will you be kind and gentle, or wild and willful? Will you serve others, or seek only your own gain? Or maybe you’ll walk a third path… Time will tell. Your fate is yours alone. It depends on you—and your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based RPG set in a <strong>free-form Slavic fantasy world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited freedom of choice</strong> – Every decision shapes the story, creating a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> – Unlock different outcomes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intriguing story</strong> – A tale that changes and deepens with each choice</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate casts its dice—and I see. I see that you'll take on the role of a girl. Hair like fire, born in a black hut near the graveyard. It's no easy role, and your choices are many: will you be kind and gentle, or wild and willful? Will you serve others, or seek only your own gain? Or maybe you’ll walk a third path… Time will tell. Your fate is yours alone. It depends on you—and your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based RPG set in a <strong>free-form Slavic fantasy world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited freedom of choice</strong> – Every decision shapes the story, creating a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> – Unlock different outcomes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intriguing story</strong> – A tale that changes and deepens with each choice</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A text-based RPG with a nonlinear story set in a free Slavic fantasy world. Shape the heroine's character through your choices and unlock multiple endings. Mystery, folklore, and relationships — your fate depends only on you.",
